    "directions": [
      "In a thick bottom pan, add butter, oil, ginger, green chilli, onion, salt to taste, degi red chilli powder, turmeric powder, coriander powder and saute it well.",
      "Add tomato and little water and cook on medium flame.",
      "Add dry fenugreek leaves and mix well. Remove spoonfull prepared masala and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In the remaining masala, add cashew nut, tomato ketchup, butter, sugar, degi red chilli powder and mix everything well.",
      "Once it's cool down, blend it into a smooth puree. Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a large bowl, add chicken mince, white bread crumb, salt to taste, prepared masala, degi red chilli powder, garam masala, poha powder, coriander leaves and mix everything well.",
      "Heat oil in a kadai and in meanwhile make bite size balls from the mixture and deep fry them in medium hot oil until golden brown and crispy.",
      "Remove on an absorbent paper and then serve them with prepared gravy.",
      "In a pan, add butter, let it melt, add fried chicken balls, fresh cream, coriander leaves and saute it well.",
      "In a pan, add butter, let it melt and add the prepared gravy and mix well."
    ],
